{
  "format": "mosael-workflow",
  "version": 1,
  "workflow_revision": 1,
  "name": "商品 → 带货口播短视频",
  "description": "给一张商品图和几条卖点,写一条分拍的口播脚本,每一拍出一张带商品的画面、按这一拍的时长铺上时间线,配上口播与屏幕短句,导出竖屏成片。卖点只用你给的那几条,不编功效和数据。",
  "graph_hash": "c085b9b28ae6503237f04858e1975cf85a83b12d6c56af8bcd3feb9520b40ed0",
  "graph": {
    "meta": {
      "template_id": "product_pitch_short",
      "template_version": 1,
      "source": "official"
    },
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "type": "start",
        "name": "填商品与卖点",
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "params": {
            "product_name": "",
            "selling_points": "一行一条,只写你能负责的卖点",
            "audience": "刷竖屏短视频的年轻观众",
            "target_duration_seconds": 30,
            "voice_id": "",
            "width": 1080,
            "height": 1920,
            "fps": 30
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "product_photo",
        "type": "asset",
        "name": "选择商品图",
        "position": {
          "x": 330,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "asset_id": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "pitch_script",
        "type": "llm",
        "name": "写分拍口播脚本",
        "position": {
          "x": 650,
          "y": 120
        },
        "config": {
          "profile_id": "",
          "model": "",
          "preset": "creative",
          "system": "你是带货短视频的编导。用户给你一件商品和几条卖点，你要写一条 20-45 秒、能直接拍的\n口播脚本，按\"拍\"拆开。\n\n硬性要求：\n- 前三秒必须给出观看理由，不要从\"大家好\"开始。\n- 每一拍的 narration 念出来不能超过这一拍的 seconds：中文按每秒约 4 个字估，宁短勿长。\n- visual_prompt 用英文写这一拍的画面，**商品必须出现在画面里**；不要写机位参数，不要在画面里\n  生成文字、logo 或水印。\n- 卖点只能来自用户给的那几条，不要编造功效、成分、资质或数据。\n- caption 是屏幕上的短句，不是把 narration 原样抄一遍。\n\n只输出符合 JSON Schema 的对象。",
          "prompt": "商品名称：{{start.product_name}}\n卖点（只能用这些）：\n{{start.selling_points}}\n目标观众：{{start.audience}}\n成片目标时长：{{start.target_duration_seconds}} 秒\n\n请写出分拍脚本。各拍 seconds 之和要接近目标时长。",
          "response_format": "json_schema",
          "json_schema_name": "product_pitch_script",
          "json_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "hook_line": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "前三秒的钩子,中文"
              },
              "beats": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "narration": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "这一拍要念的口播原文,中文;念出来不超过本拍时长"
                    },
                    "seconds": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 2,
                      "maximum": 8,
                      "description": "这一拍多长"
                    },
                    "visual_prompt": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "这一拍的画面,英文;商品必须在画面里"
                    },
                    "caption": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "屏幕上的短句,不超过 14 字"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "narration",
                    "seconds",
                    "visual_prompt",
                    "caption"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                },
                "minItems": 2
              },
              "call_to_action": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "结尾行动号召,中文"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "hook_line",
              "beats",
              "call_to_action"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "json_schema_strict": "true",
          "temperature": 0.6,
          "max_tokens": 6000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "pitch_project",
        "type": "project_sequence_create",
        "name": "建立竖屏成片时间线",
        "position": {
          "x": 650,
          "y": 420
        },
        "config": {
          "name": "{{start.product_name}} · 带货短片",
          "width": "{{start.width}}",
          "height": "{{start.height}}",
          "fps": "{{start.fps}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "shoot_beats",
        "type": "loop_foreach",
        "name": "逐拍出画面并上时间线",
        "position": {
          "x": 970,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "items": "{{pitch_script.json.beats}}",
          "inputs": {
            "product_asset_id": "{{product_photo.asset_id}}",
            "sequence_id": "{{pitch_project.sequence_id}}",
            "video_track_id": "{{pitch_project.video_track_id}}",
            "project_id": "{{pitch_project.project_id}}"
          },
          "body": {
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "beat_frame",
                "type": "ai_generate",
                "name": "出这一拍的画面",
                "position": {
                  "x": 80,
                  "y": 140
                },
                "config": {
                  "provider": "",
                  "provider_profile_id": "",
                  "model": "",
                  "kind": "image",
                  "prompt": "{{loop.item.visual_prompt}} The product in the reference image must be reproduced EXACTLY: identical cut, silhouette, colour, fabric texture, weave, print scale and placement, stitching, buttons, trims and any logo or label. Do not redesign, restyle, recolour, resize the print, add or remove details. Only the wearer, pose, setting and lighting may change. Vertical composition for a phone screen, photorealistic, no text, no logo overlay, no watermark.",
                  "negative_prompt": "different garment, altered pattern, changed colour, distorted print, redesigned collar or sleeves, extra logos, text, watermark, deformed hands, extra limbs",
                  "parameters": {},
                  "source_assets": [
                    "{{input.product_asset_id}}:reference_image"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "beat_on_timeline",
                "type": "timeline_append",
                "name": "按这一拍的时长铺上去",
                "position": {
                  "x": 400,
                  "y": 140
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "asset_id": "",
                  "track_id": "{{input.video_track_id}}",
                  "max_duration": "{{loop.item.seconds}}"
                },
                "inputs": [
                  "asset_id"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "edges": [
              {
                "id": "d-beat_frame-asset_id-beat_on_timeline-asset_id",
                "source": "beat_frame",
                "target": "beat_on_timeline",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "asset_id",
                "target_input": "asset_id"
              }
            ]
          },
          "concurrency": 1,
          "output": "{{beat_on_timeline.clip_id}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "voice_over",
        "type": "synthesize_speech",
        "name": "合成整条口播",
        "position": {
          "x": 970,
          "y": 480
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "{{pitch_script.json.hook_line}}\n{{pitch_script.json.call_to_action}}",
          "engine": "clone",
          "voice": "{{start.voice_id}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "voice_on_timeline",
        "type": "timeline_append",
        "name": "把口播放到音频轨",
        "position": {
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 480
        },
        "config": {
          "sequence_id": "",
          "asset_id": "",
          "track_id": "",
          "at": 0
        },
        "inputs": [
          "sequence_id",
          "asset_id",
          "track_id"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "export_short",
        "type": "export_sequence",
        "name": "导出成片",
        "position": {
          "x": 1610,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "sequence_id": ""
        },
        "inputs": [
          "sequence_id"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "done_notice",
        "type": "notify",
        "name": "成片完成通知",
        "position": {
          "x": 1930,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "title": "带货短片已导出",
          "body": "{{start.product_name}} 的口播短片已完成,共 {{shoot_beats.count}} 拍。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "output",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "交付成片与脚本",
        "position": {
          "x": 2250,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "values": {
            "final_asset_id": "{{export_short.asset_id}}",
            "script": "{{pitch_script.json}}",
            "beat_clip_ids": "{{shoot_beats.results}}",
            "voice_asset_id": "{{voice_over.asset_id}}",
            "sequence_id": "{{pitch_project.sequence_id}}"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "id": "start_photo",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "product_photo"
      },
      {
        "id": "start_script",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "pitch_script"
      },
      {
        "id": "start_project",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "pitch_project"
      },
      {
        "id": "script_shoot",
        "source": "pitch_script",
        "target": "shoot_beats"
      },
      {
        "id": "project_shoot",
        "source": "pitch_project",
        "target": "shoot_beats"
      },
      {
        "id": "photo_shoot",
        "source": "product_photo",
        "target": "shoot_beats"
      },
      {
        "id": "script_voice",
        "source": "pitch_script",
        "target": "voice_over"
      },
      {
        "id": "shoot_export",
        "source": "shoot_beats",
        "target": "export_short"
      },
      {
        "id": "voice_export",
        "source": "voice_on_timeline",
        "target": "export_short"
      },
      {
        "id": "export_notice",
        "source": "export_short",
        "target": "done_notice"
      },
      {
        "id": "notice_output",
        "source": "done_notice",
        "target": "output"
      },
      {
        "id": "d-pitch_project-sequence_id-voice_on_timeline-sequence_id",
        "source": "pitch_project",
        "target": "voice_on_timeline",
        "kind": "data",
        "source_output": "sequence_id",
        "target_input": "sequence_id"
      },
      {
        "id": "d-voice_over-asset_id-voice_on_timeline-asset_id",
        "source": "voice_over",
        "target": "voice_on_timeline",
        "kind": "data",
        "source_output": "asset_id",
        "target_input": "asset_id"
      },
      {
        "id": "d-pitch_project-audio_track_id-voice_on_timeline-track_id",
        "source": "pitch_project",
        "target": "voice_on_timeline",
        "kind": "data",
        "source_output": "audio_track_id",
        "target_input": "track_id"
      },
      {
        "id": "d-pitch_project-sequence_id-export_short-sequence_id",
        "source": "pitch_project",
        "target": "export_short",
        "kind": "data",
        "source_output": "sequence_id",
        "target_input": "sequence_id"
      }
    ]
  }
}
